@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To begin the validation process, start by checking the received invoice for any errors;
:Simultaneously;
:v1: check for errors ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
fork
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:If any errors are found, continue with the process;
endif
fork again
if () then ([v1 = 'No'])
:If no errors are found, mark the "invoice entered correctly" box;
endif
fork again
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:highlight any errors on the invoice entry form and keep a record of the DEO's performance;
endif
end fork
:the process ends;
stop
@enduml